{"id":"925a3a1f25b1a36b","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-top7-frame.md","title":"ZFC Top7 Frame","display":"df-zfc-top7-frame — ZFC Top7 Frame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top7-frame","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top7-frame"],"display":"df-zfc-top7-frame — ZFC Top7 Frame","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top7-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top7-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top7-frame — ZFC Top7 Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a9536cc1c6c86510\" href=\"?note=a9536cc1c6c86510\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R,j,m\\in V\">\\(L,R,j,m\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (complete-lattice predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a9536cc1c6c86510\" href=\"?note=a9536cc1c6c86510\" title=\"58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice\">58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S(L,R,j,m)\\leftrightarrow{}\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(L,R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(j,\\mathcal P(L),L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(m,L\\times L,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,j(A)\\rangle\\in R))\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle j(A),u\\rangle\\in R)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle m(\\langle a,b\\rangle),a\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\langle m(\\langle a,b\\rangle),b\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\forall \\ell\\in L\\;((\\langle\\ell,a\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle\\ell,b\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle\\ell,m(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\rangle\\in R)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a\\in L\\;\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\nm(\\langle a,j(A)\\rangle)=j(\\{m(\\langle a,x\\rangle):x\\in A\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S(L,R,j,m)\\leftrightarrow{}\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(L,R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(j,\\mathcal P(L),L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(m,L\\times L,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,j(A)\\rangle\\in R))\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle j(A),u\\rangle\\in R)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle m(\\langle a,b\\rangle),a\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\langle m(\\langle a,b\\rangle),b\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\forall \\ell\\in L\\;((\\langle\\ell,a\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle\\ell,b\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle\\ell,m(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\rangle\\in R)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall a\\in L\\;\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\nm(\\langle a,j(A)\\rangle)=j(\\{m(\\langle a,x\\rangle):x\\in A\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> are tied to the order as arbitrary joins and binary meets; the last conjunct is finite-meet distributivity over arbitrary joins.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"a9536cc1c6c86510","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"a9536cc1c6c86510","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (complete-lattice predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-poset-complete-lattice]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}(f,A,B)$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,R,j,m\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}(f,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7Frame}_S(L,R,j,m)\\leftrightarrow{}\\mathrm{ZfcPosetCompleteLattice}_S(L,R)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(j,\\mathcal P(L),L)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(m,L\\times L,L)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,j(A)\\rangle\\in R))\n\\land\\forall u\\in L\\;((\\forall a\\in A\\;\\langle a,u\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle j(A),u\\rangle\\in R)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall a,b\\in L\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle m(\\langle a,b\\rangle),a\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\langle m(\\langle a,b\\rangle),b\\rangle\\in R\n\\land\\forall \\ell\\in L\\;((\\langle\\ell,a\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle\\ell,b\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\langle\\ell,m(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\rangle\\in R)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall a\\in L\\;\\forall A\\subseteq L\\;\nm(\\langle a,j(A)\\rangle)=j(\\{m(\\langle a,x\\rangle):x\\in A\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false}],"bytes":1702,"backlinks":[{"id":"9683fba1d3218b96","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f038e6f0c0223f39","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3631","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-top7-frame.md|58-df-zfc-top7-frame]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a9536cc1c6c86510","36d7463d215be751"]}